OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785786508
OL,3,CWarning to avoid area and stop flying
OL,4,Cdrones as forest fire spreads
OL,6,FFirefighters tackling a forest blaze
OL,7,Fin Rhondda Cynon Taf and have warned
OL,8,Fpeople to avoid the area and not fly
OL,9,Fdrones nearby.
OL,11,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue said it is
OL,12,Fresponding to a wildfire in the
OL,13,FBlaenllechau and Ferndale area.
OL,15,FOn Monday (3 August) morning, the
OL,16,Fblaze on Llanwonno Mountain had
OL,17,Falready spread to around 150 hectares
OL,18,Fof land - the equivalent size of about
OL,19,F210 football pitches. That is compared
OL,20,Fto covering more than 20 hectares the
OL,21,Fday before.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/5
