FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785786508
OL,3,CWarning to avoid area and stop flying
OL,4,Cdrones as forest fire spreads
OL,6,FIn a statement, the fires service
OL,7,Fsaid: "SWFRS currently has eight fire
OL,8,Fengines, three water bowsers,
OL,9,Fspecialist wildfire crews and officers
OL,10,Fresponding to a wildfire in the
OL,11,FBlaenllechau and Ferndale area.
OL,13,F"Please avoid travelling to the area
OL,14,Fwhile emergency crews deal with the
OL,15,Fincident. If you are nearby, stay
OL,16,Findoors where possible and keep
OL,17,Fwindows and doors closed to reduce the
OL,18,Fimpact of smoke.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785786508
OL,3,CWarning to avoid area and stop flying
OL,4,Cdrones as forest fire spreads
OL,6,F"We would like to thank local
OL,7,Fresidents for their continued support
OL,8,Fand apologise for any disruption
OL,9,Fcaused."
OL,11,FIt added a plea to members of the
OL,12,Fpublic "to avoid flying their own
OL,13,Fdrones above the incident ground" as
OL,14,Fit would impact the work of the fire
OL,15,Fservice's specialist drone team
OL,16,Fhelping to fight the fire.
OL,18,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) manage
OL,19,Fland affected by the fire. It said it
OL,20,Fcontinues to support the emergency
OL,21,Fservice response at Llanwonno.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785786508
OL,3,CWarning to avoid area and stop flying
OL,4,Cdrones as forest fire spreads
OL,6,FNRW said on social media: "Our teams
OL,7,Fhave been on site throughout the
OL,8,Fweekend, and are back on site again
OL,9,Ftoday, working closely with fire and
OL,10,Frescue service colleagues to provide
OL,11,Flocal knowledge of the site and
OL,12,Flandscape, as well as providing
OL,13,Fpractical support on the ground. This
OL,14,Fincludes creating firebreaks and
OL,15,Fproviding tractor bowsers to support
OL,16,Ffirefighting operations.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
