OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785786508
OL,3,CWarning to avoid area and stop flying
OL,4,Cdrones as forest fire spreads
OL,6,F"The fire has already affected a
OL,7,Fsignificant area of land (approx. 150
OL,8,Fhectares), and our immediate priority
OL,9,Fis to support the fire service's
OL,10,Fefforts to bring the incident under
OL,11,Fcontrol and limit any further spread.
OL,13,F"We will continue to work alongside
OL,14,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,Fand other partners for as long as
OL,16,Frequired, while also beginning to
OL,17,Fconsider the potential impacts on the
OL,18,Fhabitats, wildlife and landscape
OL,19,Faffected by the fire."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/5
